格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Solarized + Selenized themes for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): four faithful palettes registered into the theme runtime, with a Settings picker row and canonical code-block syntax colors","id":"gh:1334197173","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"Solarized-dsh-theme","slug":"zhijun-dai/Solarized-dsh-theme","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","plugin","selenized","solarized","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Solarized + Selenized themes for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): four faithful palettes registered into the "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"theme runtime, with a Settings picker row and canonical code-block syntax colors"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Solarized + Selenized for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Intro"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The classic low-contrast, eye-friendly palettes for\nDeepSeek Harness — one\npackage covering **Web GU"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"I** (`dsh web`), **DSH Desktop** and **dsh-TUI**:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- ☀️ **Solarized** — Ethan\nSchoonover's carefully tuned 16-color system, designed for long reading\ns"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"essions without eye strain.\n- 🟢 **Selenized** — its\nrefined take: the same low-contrast philosophy w"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ith modernized hues and\nbetter color distinction."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Both come in dark and light, registered into the built-in theme system on a\nlevel with the light/dar"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"k/system choices — with canonical syntax colors for\ncode blocks and a one-click switch row in **Sett"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ings → General** that\nremembers your choice."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- 👁️ **Eye-friendly by design** — Solarized's palette is luminance-tuned,\nnot hue-picked, so text st"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ays readable for hours; Selenized keeps the\ncomfort with cleaner, more distinct accents.\n- 🎨 **Faith"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ful palettes** — every color is a canonical Solarized /\nSelenized value; no default DeepSeek blue-gr"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ay leaks through.\n- 🖥️ **Canonical syntax colors** — code blocks follow the classic Solarized\nsyntax"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" mapping (keyword magenta, string cyan, number blue…).\n- 🖱️ **Component-level accents** — bubbles, t"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ool-call rows, code tags,\ntimestamps and hover interactions tinted from the palettes.\n- 💻 **dsh-TUI "},{"id":"p9s7","text":"themes** — one install command drops the four themes into\nyour terminal client; auto-synced on every"},{"id":"p9s8","text":" start.\n- 🔄 **Update check** — Settings silently checks npm for a newer release\n(manual button too) "},{"id":"p9s9","text":"and shows a copyable upgrade command.\n- 🧠 **Choice remembered** — survives restarts and model switch"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"es; turning\nit off restores the light/dark choice you had before, not a forced\n\"system\". Desktop por"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"t churn is covered by durable state under\n`$DSH_HOME`.\n- ⚙️ **Zero intrusion** — switching to **Defa"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ult** restores the built-in\nappearance pixel-identical."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Previews"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"☀️ Solarized Dark"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"🌞 Solarized Light"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"🟢 Selenized Dark"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"🌿 Selenized Light"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"From GitHub (recommended — always the latest):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"From npm:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> 💡 The npm release may lag slightly behind GitHub. For the very latest,\n> use the GitHub install ab"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ove (pin a branch with `#branch-name`)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"For DSH Desktop, target the desktop profile:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### dsh-TUI (terminal themes)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The same package syncs the four themes into your dsh-TUI. Install into the\nTUI profile and they land"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" on the first start:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Then pick a theme inside the TUI: `/theme solarized-dark`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> 💡 Installed into a web/desktop profile of a user who also runs dsh-TUI,\n> the themes stay in sync "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"on every web start. No `~/.dsh-tui` on disk?\n> Strict no-op, nothing is created."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Restart the web server afterwards:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Open the web UI, go to **Settings → General**, and pick one of the four\nthemes (or **Default** to fo"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"llow the built-in appearance). Choice is saved\nper browser and restored at boot."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"**Q: Why do the colors look \"washed out\"?**"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"That's the point — Solarized deliberately keeps contrast low so text stays\nreadable for hours withou"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"t eye strain. If you want more punch, Selenized\noffers the same comfort with stronger accents."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**Q: How is my choice remembered?**"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Browser `localStorage` (instant) plus a durable file under `$DSH_HOME` for\nDesktop — survives restar"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ts, model switches and per-launch port changes.\nYour explicit light/dark/system pick in the built-in"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" Appearance row always\nwins."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"**Q: How do I upgrade?**"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Re-run the install command, or check the Settings row — it silently tells\nyou when a newer version e"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"xists and shows the copyable upgrade command.\nThen restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## 💝 Thanks to"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- zhijun-dai\n- Ethan Schoonover — Solarized\n- Jan Warchoł — Selenized\n- KinGao294/dsh-skin — the ref"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"erence theme plugin this port is modeled on\n- DeepSeek"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"🏆 Listed on Awesome DSH Plugin"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Copyright © 2026-present zhijun-dai"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
